    "#| label: fig-performance\n",
    "#| fig-cap: Per-indicator extraction accuracy on the human-reviewed subset of public release v1.2 (4,608 firm--indicator--year pairs covering Euro Stoxx 50 and DAX 40 companies in reporting years 2024--2025). Bars are sorted by accuracy. Each stacked bar shows the composition of the reviewed pairs into five outcomes; the rightmost annotation reports the number of reviewed pairs $n$ and the per-indicator accuracy. The overall accuracy of the pipeline on this set is 72\\%.\n",
